1
00:00:38,159 --> 00:00:39,439
Drawing God,

2
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,640
I just want to quietly create

3
00:00:41,679 --> 00:00:43,439
in the cold palace.

4
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:45,159
Must you send the Wind God

5
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:46,280
to steal my work

6
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:47,399
for such a humble wish?

7
00:01:09,599 --> 00:01:10,000
Thank you.

8
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:11,719
What's your name?

9
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:16,400
I'm leaving.

10
00:01:18,879 --> 00:01:20,480
A youth should have ambition.

11
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:22,599
Why do you always stay at home?

12
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,040
This is a family feud.

13
00:01:25,799 --> 00:01:26,920
How can I fight without a home?

14
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:36,000
Family feud, mirror of the country.

15
00:01:37,599 --> 00:01:38,359
Nice.

16
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,719
This idea is really good.

17
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:23,879
My new story

18
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:24,960
is about martial arts.

19
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,560
A heroine who punishes the wicked,

20
00:03:26,639 --> 00:03:27,439
helps the poor,

21
00:03:28,039 --> 00:03:29,759
and hangs corrupt officials on the city gate.

22
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,080
What do you think?

23
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,479
After hanging, the house should be searched.

24
00:03:56,879 --> 00:03:58,000
The money should be given to the people.

25
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,319
If not,

26
00:03:59,639 --> 00:04:00,400
there will be endless troubles.

27
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:03,439
And the heroine keeps a cat.

28
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:04,719
The cat is very good.

29
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:09,120
And thanks for the medicine.

30
00:04:13,719 --> 00:04:15,599
A defeated general has no honor.

31
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,279
War is no joke.

32
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:18,839
It must be taken seriously.

33
00:04:21,879 --> 00:04:23,040
A fox repays a debt for eight years.

34
00:04:23,439 --> 00:04:24,160
I'm tired of it.

35
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:25,600
If no response,

36
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:26,519
I'll just run away.

37
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,480
I don't need the favor.

38
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,439
I don't want to be trapped.

39
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:34,120
Everything can be a sword.

40
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,319
But burnt branches hurt hands.

41
00:04:36,759 --> 00:04:37,480
Here's ink and brush.

42
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:38,480
Use them.

43
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,319
What are you hiding from?

44
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,319
Afraid of being exposed by me?

45
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:03,040
Alright, I'm done looking at you.

46
00:05:03,519 --> 00:05:04,319
Aren't you tired squatting down?

47
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:05,680
Get up.

48
00:05:12,759 --> 00:05:13,839
Why don't you talk?

49
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,240
Could it be

50
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,279
that you're a little mute?

51
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,120
Actually, I saw you last time.

52
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,439
I'm older than you.

53
00:05:25,079 --> 00:05:26,120
Next time we meet,

54
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:27,319
remember to call me sister.

55
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:28,120
Did you hear me?

56
00:05:30,839 --> 00:05:32,120
Who wants to call you sister?

57
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,720
So you can talk.

58
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:36,920
[From then on,]

59
00:05:37,199 --> 00:05:37,959
[every few days,]

60
00:05:38,519 --> 00:05:39,240
[he would appear]

61
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:39,959
[on the other side of the wall.]

62
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,959
[We talked about scripts,]

63
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:42,879
[and the martial arts world.]

64
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,199
[Three months passed in a blink.]

65
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:46,759
Little guard,

66
00:05:47,399 --> 00:05:48,160
did you fight again today?

67
00:05:49,279 --> 00:05:50,199
[At first, I thought]

68
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:51,360
[he was a reserved man]

69
00:05:51,399 --> 00:05:52,079
[who was not good at talking.]

70
00:05:52,639 --> 00:05:53,360
[Who would have thought]

71
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:54,920
[that after getting to know him,]

72
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,319
[he had a lively side.]

73
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,439
Did we win or lose?

74
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,600
Do you look down on me?

75
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,399
How could we lose?

76
00:06:04,839 --> 00:06:05,959
I'm just worried

77
00:06:06,319 --> 00:06:08,120
you'll get hurt again.

78
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,399
You're just a guard.

79
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:10,560
Don't be so earnest.

80
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,759
It's just a little money.

81
00:06:11,959 --> 00:06:12,720
Don't risk your life.

82
00:06:25,959 --> 00:06:26,639
This is for you.

83
00:06:30,079 --> 00:06:31,639
They say don't pick up men on the street.

84
00:06:32,279 --> 00:06:33,839
But when I first came to this world,

85
00:06:34,399 --> 00:06:35,720
I still made the mistake

86
00:06:35,759 --> 00:06:36,759
all women make.

87
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,040
[I wanted to give a homeless man]

88
00:06:39,439 --> 00:06:40,040
[a home.]

89
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:41,639
Water.

90
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,240
Water.

91
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:51,959
It's me.

92
00:06:55,079 --> 00:06:55,920
Lie down.

93
00:06:56,319 --> 00:06:56,959
I'm here.

94
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:58,480
Why are you here?

95
00:06:59,439 --> 00:07:00,319
It's so late.

96
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:03,959
You're sick.

97
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,000
I'm just too scared.

98
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,600
You're not a doctor.

99
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:12,439
But I...

100
00:07:13,079 --> 00:07:14,040
should be here.

101
00:07:15,639 --> 00:07:16,360
Your drawing book

102
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:17,639
says so.

103
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:21,480
I read your drawing book that day.

104
00:07:22,279 --> 00:07:23,240
It says

105
00:07:23,519 --> 00:07:25,000
when the girl you like falls ill,

106
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:27,800
you should prepare some fruits, cakes,

107
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:30,879
and interesting books for her.

108
00:07:32,639 --> 00:07:34,199
You must not be a useless man

109
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,879
who only knows to say

110
00:07:35,959 --> 00:07:36,839
drink more hot water.

111
00:07:40,079 --> 00:07:41,439
What girl you like?

112
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,879
Sister, stop beating me.

113
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:53,759
I learned a new

114
00:07:53,759 --> 00:07:54,800
interesting thing.

115
00:07:55,319 --> 00:07:56,439
I'll play it for you.

116
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:11,439
What tune is this?

117
00:08:12,879 --> 00:08:13,839
You play it so well.

118
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:20,680
It's just an unknown tune.

119
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,399
If you like it,

120
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,879
I'll play it for you every day.

121
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:51,440
[Could it be that Gu Jiachen]

122
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:52,960
[is the guard from back then?]

123
00:08:55,399 --> 00:08:56,919
[What exactly happened back then]

124
00:08:58,519 --> 00:08:59,960
[that caused you to tear your soul]

125
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,360
[into pieces?]

126
00:09:02,919 --> 00:09:03,759
[At this point,]

127
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,679
[I have no choice but to ask her myself.]

128
00:09:14,519 --> 00:09:15,159
Gu Jiachen!

129
00:09:22,759 --> 00:09:23,360
Shen Li!

130
00:09:26,799 --> 00:09:28,679
Lady... Lady Feng!

131
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:29,399
Who did this?

132
00:09:29,879 --> 00:09:30,480
Where's Gu Jiachen?

133
00:09:31,519 --> 00:09:32,080
Your Highness

134
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:33,759
was affected by

135
00:09:34,519 --> 00:09:34,960
the...

136
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,080
Ye Xuan

137
00:09:37,879 --> 00:09:40,240
couldn't control it.

138
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:41,919
The belt?

139
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:43,960
I thought

140
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:44,919
there was something wrong with it.

141
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,559
What's going on with that belt?

142
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:48,039
Ye Xuan

143
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:50,600
is going to the Palace of Supreme Harmony

144
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,320
to kill the Emperor.

145
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,080
What?

146
00:10:04,679 --> 00:10:06,200
His Highness also said

147
00:10:06,679 --> 00:10:09,440
he shouldn't have involved you.

148
00:10:10,919 --> 00:10:11,720
That jade belt

149
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,799
has been kept in the study

150
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:16,159
since His Highness was a child.

151
00:10:16,879 --> 00:10:18,480
His Majesty said that the way of an emperor

152
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,720
must first suppress human desires and cut off family ties,

153
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,279
and must not be soft-hearted.

154
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,200
He said the Crown Prince was too soft

155
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:25,440
and too sentimental,

156
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:26,960
and not fit to be an emperor.

157
00:10:30,279 --> 00:10:31,919
[Whenever His Majesty was frustrated,]

158
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:33,600
[or was challenged by the censors,]

159
00:10:34,159 --> 00:10:35,679
[as long as there was any dissatisfaction,]

160
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:37,480
[he would summon the Crown Prince]

161
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,600
[to that study room,]

162
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,639
[in the name of teaching,]

163
00:10:41,159 --> 00:10:42,399
[but in reality, it was corporal punishment.]

164
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:43,679
[After the beating,]

165
00:10:44,399 --> 00:10:46,039
He'd make the Crown Prince kneel in thanks for the lesson.

166
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:48,159
[That's why the Prince]

167
00:10:48,879 --> 00:10:49,960
[wants to kill him,]

168
00:10:50,759 --> 00:10:53,120
[to avenge the grievances in his heart.]

169
00:10:59,399 --> 00:11:00,159
[Gu Jiachen,]

170
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,639
[you must stay safe.]

171
00:11:02,399 --> 00:11:03,480
[I still have questions to ask you.]

172
00:11:03,799 --> 00:11:05,200
Yexuan went to the Palace of Supreme Harmony.

173
00:11:06,559 --> 00:11:08,120
His Highness came out of the East Palace.

174
00:11:08,679 --> 00:11:09,960
His face was dark.

175
00:11:10,799 --> 00:11:12,360
The momentum

176
00:11:12,399 --> 00:11:13,879
was going to kill someone.

177
00:11:14,799 --> 00:11:15,720
I'm sure

178
00:11:17,039 --> 00:11:18,200
he is Yexuan.

179
00:11:19,919 --> 00:11:21,120
There was no news

180
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,200
about the Jade Belt.

181
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:23,840
I almost thought

182
00:11:24,159 --> 00:11:25,679
His Highness

183
00:11:25,679 --> 00:11:26,399
was cured.

184
00:11:27,159 --> 00:11:30,240
Now, it's not in vain that I made a plan.

185
00:11:30,879 --> 00:11:32,519
I have an unexpected gain.

186
00:11:33,279 --> 00:11:35,120
But what if something goes wrong?

187
00:11:35,679 --> 00:11:36,399
Let him go.

188
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:37,840
It's best if he dies.

189
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:38,759
Then,

190
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,759
the Crown Prince killed the Emperor

191
00:11:40,919 --> 00:11:41,960
and usurped the throne.

192
00:11:43,159 --> 00:11:45,000
Although the Emperor has no other heirs,

193
00:11:45,399 --> 00:11:46,639
it's not difficult

194
00:11:46,799 --> 00:11:47,639
to pick a compliant one

195
00:11:48,159 --> 00:11:49,399
from the royal family.

196
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:51,519
You're so wise.

197
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,639
After all,

198
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:55,759
I just need a

199
00:11:55,799 --> 00:11:56,720
compliant dog.

200
00:11:57,039 --> 00:11:58,639
Gu Jiachen is disobedient,

201
00:11:59,559 --> 00:12:01,799
and there are plenty of others who want to be this dog.

202
00:12:10,879 --> 00:12:11,639
Your Highness.

203
00:12:13,639 --> 00:12:14,919
How is father feeling today?

204
00:12:15,639 --> 00:12:16,799
Your Highness, you've come just in time.

205
00:12:17,399 --> 00:12:18,360
His Majesty

206
00:12:18,399 --> 00:12:19,960
has been unconscious for the past few days.

207
00:12:20,679 --> 00:12:22,879
Today, he's a bit more spirited

208
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,120
and can talk.

209
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:28,679
Chen.

210
00:12:29,279 --> 00:12:29,879
I'm here.

211
00:12:30,399 --> 00:12:31,080
You all go ahead and leave.

212
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:34,080
I want to talk to my father alone.

213
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:35,600
Yes.

214
00:12:54,919 --> 00:12:55,679
Old man,

215
00:12:57,399 --> 00:12:58,799
do you still recognize me?

216
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:02,799
You...

217
00:13:03,679 --> 00:13:04,279
You...

218
00:13:04,639 --> 00:13:05,320
You...

219
00:13:05,399 --> 00:13:07,120
That's right, it's me.

220
00:13:07,879 --> 00:13:09,240
I'm the monster

221
00:13:09,799 --> 00:13:10,720
you whipped

222
00:13:10,759 --> 00:13:12,039
out of this body.

223
00:13:12,279 --> 00:13:13,440
The weather is quite strange.

224
00:13:13,879 --> 00:13:15,000
Looks like a storm is coming.

225
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:16,240
Let's go, hurry up.

226
00:13:16,679 --> 00:13:17,440
Your Highness is here.

227
00:13:17,559 --> 00:13:18,679
We're not needed today.

228
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:23,480
Who's there?
